WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.400
Here he comes...

00:00:03.983 --> 00:00:05.276
The man himself!

00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:07.779
The crowd's energy changed...

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:08.613
Why's that?

00:00:08.738 --> 00:00:12.409
No one expected to see
this man compete again!

00:00:12.492 --> 00:00:15.286
Every person in here
is abuzz with excitement!

00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:18.540
Suiryu has entered the ring!

00:00:18.748 --> 00:00:21.000
His opponent is...Max!

00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:23.211
Look at Mr. Popular.

00:00:23.753 --> 00:00:26.089
Could he really be so much
better than me?

00:00:27.715 --> 00:00:28.883
No, not at all.

00:00:29.259 --> 00:00:31.469
Remember back, Lightning Max...

00:00:32.554 --> 00:00:35.098
This isn't the one youre after.

00:00:36.266 --> 00:00:40.103
Compared to that monster,
this guy's just a scrub.

00:00:41.104 --> 00:00:42.397
Suiryu!

00:00:42.522 --> 00:00:44.774
I have to get stronger.

00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:47.485
If I fail, I can't be a hero
and protect people.

00:00:48.027 --> 00:00:49.446
Sorry it has to be this way,

00:00:49.612 --> 00:00:52.323
but I consider you
a Capable opponent.

00:00:52.449 --> 00:00:54.117
So my new
monster-fighting technique

00:00:54.242 --> 00:00:55.869
will be tested out on you!

00:00:56.327 --> 00:00:58.580
So you're a pro hero then?

00:00:59.539 --> 00:01:00.498
I see.

00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:03.418
You train with
lofty ideals in mind.

00:01:04.043 --> 00:01:07.130
I guess everyone's got some reason
for seeking strength.

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:11.176
Fighters, take your stance.

00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:12.844
Begin!

00:01:13.052 --> 00:01:14.512
Lightning...

00:01:14.888 --> 00:01:17.640
...-Bigwheel Double Ax Kick!

00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:24.189
The reason I sought strength...

00:01:35.825 --> 00:01:38.578
...was so I could live the easy life.

00:01:39.287 --> 00:01:41.164
I was stronger. Sorry.

00:01:56.012 --> 00:01:58.097
Through the once tranquil town

00:01:58.181 --> 00:02:00.475
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:02:00.517 --> 00:02:04.395
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:02:05.313 --> 00:02:07.398
Who ts going to take the lead

00:02:07.524 --> 00:02:09.901
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:02:10.109 --> 00:02:14.822
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:02:14.989 --> 00:02:16.866
We know, We are...

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.577
HEROES!

00:02:19.702 --> 00:02:21.329
Why were you

00:02:21.454 --> 00:02:23.581
born of evil?

00:02:23.706 --> 00:02:25.708
If you wish to know

00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:28.086
I shall tell!

00:02:28.211 --> 00:02:34.050
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:37.554
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:02:38.888 --> 00:02:43.434
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:48.106
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:02:48.231 --> 00:02:52.777
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:02:52.902 --> 00:02:58.908
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:02.370
He must fight!

00:03:11.546 --> 00:03:16.968
THE MONSTER UPRISING

00:03:17.218 --> 00:03:18.261
I did. Why?

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.472
Wait, how're you so calm?

00:03:22.724 --> 00:03:25.226
Oh, I get it.
Because he's such a newb...

00:03:25.602 --> 00:03:27.770
A Class A hero defeated by
a single kick...

00:03:28.229 --> 00:03:30.940
There are more people
who are stronger than heroes

00:03:31.107 --> 00:03:32.442
than I realized.

00:03:32.942 --> 00:03:34.152
Well, it is only natural.

00:03:34.569 --> 00:03:37.363
Master Saitama was but a hobbyist
under everyone's radar.

00:03:37.697 --> 00:03:40.450
It is to be expected that
there would be more like him.

00:03:40.908 --> 00:03:43.828
Though I doubt anyone here
could rise to Master's level.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.373
That man there, however,
might satisfy Master's wish

00:03:47.457 --> 00:03:49.000
to experience martial arts.

00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:53.296
This is...

00:03:53.421 --> 00:03:54.672
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:03:54.797 --> 00:03:56.799
I see you're still riled up,

00:03:56.924 --> 00:03:59.802
but our next match features Benpats
of "The Way of the Cruel"

00:03:59.969 --> 00:04:02.013
vs. Snakebite Snek!

00:04:02.263 --> 00:04:05.808
The winner will face Suiryu
in the second round!

00:04:05.892 --> 00:04:07.393
A Class A hero?

00:04:08.478 --> 00:04:09.979
You don't look too tough.

00:04:10.438 --> 00:04:13.024
If! can beat Suiryu,
who defeated Lightning Max,

00:04:13.149 --> 00:04:16.527
it might have a positive effect
on my ranking.

00:04:16.944 --> 00:04:17.904
Here we go.

00:04:18.738 --> 00:04:19.989
Snakebite Fist!

00:04:20.865 --> 00:04:23.826
That old man style
hasn't got any tricks left!

00:04:24.077 --> 00:04:26.829
Eat knuckles,
bottom-ranked bastard!

00:04:27.288 --> 00:04:28.289
I'm not the bottom...

00:04:28.748 --> 00:04:30.500
I'm the bottom of Class A!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.418
CONTROL ROOM

00:04:32.502 --> 00:04:34.837
A group of
violent monsters is nearby!

00:04:34.921 --> 00:04:35.546
What?

00:04:35.672 --> 00:04:37.340
We have to evacuate
everyone right away!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.550
Oh crap!
I'll announce it right!

00:04:39.676 --> 00:04:41.135
That won't be necessary.

00:04:41.886 --> 00:04:42.887
Bakuzan?!

00:04:43.304 --> 00:04:45.014
Evacuating would only invite panic.

00:04:45.431 --> 00:04:48.559
But if the monster attacks
the venue...

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.479
We have all these
martial arts masters here.

00:04:51.813 --> 00:04:53.773
Could anywhere be safer?

00:04:54.232 --> 00:04:55.191
That's true...

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.359
Don't worry.

00:04:56.693 --> 00:05:01.406
If the monsters get inside the arena,
I will slay them.

00:05:01.864 --> 00:05:03.241
More monsters?

00:05:03.574 --> 00:05:05.368
There have been so many lately.

00:05:05.868 --> 00:05:08.788
Now they have come here to City C...

00:05:09.372 --> 00:05:10.998
Should I tell Master?

00:05:12.709 --> 00:05:15.044
No, I can handle this.

00:05:15.795 --> 00:05:17.463
The tournament must go on.

00:05:17.839 --> 00:05:21.050
No matter how many there are,
I will exterminate them alt.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.680
Wasn't expecting that...

00:05:26.097 --> 00:05:28.224
He's not weak at all...

00:05:29.517 --> 00:05:30.560
Snek wins!

00:05:32.103 --> 00:05:35.064
I want to believe I rank
among the strongest.

00:05:35.565 --> 00:05:38.151
But I find the reality repugnant.

00:05:38.568 --> 00:05:42.447
The top heroes are out there,
up to their necks in monsters.

00:05:43.823 --> 00:05:44.866
Incinerate.

00:05:49.871 --> 00:05:51.330
It's Demon Cyborg!

00:05:51.539 --> 00:05:52.915
That was awesome!

00:05:53.082 --> 00:05:54.250
We're saved!

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:57.336
/am currently in City C,
near the Stadium.

00:05:57.587 --> 00:05:58.588
Give me an update.

00:05:59.046 --> 00:06:02.425
Monsters have simultaneously
appeared in multiple areas.

00:06:03.092 --> 00:06:05.094
We have five contirmed
in City C alone.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.848
Mr. Demon Cyborg, there's
a monster down that way, too!

00:06:08.931 --> 00:06:10.641
And another over there!

00:06:11.058 --> 00:06:13.019
— I eliminated one.
— I came from down that way!

00:06:13.102 --> 00:06:14.771
— Where are the other four?
— Crazy monsters are all over the place!

00:06:14.896 --> 00:06:16.564
Understood. Weill direct you.

00:06:18.858 --> 00:06:21.152
Using a combined electrical shock
and strike,

00:06:21.319 --> 00:06:23.488
Boltane takes the victory!

00:06:24.155 --> 00:06:27.450
Gatling's superfast punches
were like a barrage!

00:06:27.617 --> 00:06:29.451
Hamukichi is down!

00:06:29.452 --> 00:06:30.703
VICTOR: GATLING

00:06:31.162 --> 00:06:34.707
This time, it's Dave with
a thunderous body press!

00:06:34.832 --> 00:06:37.126
VICTOR: DAVE

00:06:38.002 --> 00:06:39.712
The referee stops the fight!

00:06:39.962 --> 00:06:41.506
Choze sure is tough!

00:06:41.631 --> 00:06:43.508
Mentai was simply outclassed!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.468
Rocket Stomp!

00:06:51.474 --> 00:06:53.434
There is another monster nearby.

00:06:53.643 --> 00:06:57.814
Tell me where it is, or suffer
excruciating pain until death.

00:06:58.314 --> 00:06:59.482
Your choice.

00:06:59.816 --> 00:07:02.860
Next on the card is Jakumen
from Giga Pro Wrestling!

00:07:02.985 --> 00:07:05.780
He's up against Sourface
with his Sourface-style Kempo!

00:07:05.863 --> 00:07:08.157
A battle between newcomers!

00:07:08.491 --> 00:07:09.700
Do your best, Sourface!

00:07:09.951 --> 00:07:10.910
Shut up, you!

00:07:11.077 --> 00:07:13.579
I used to be Master Bang's
number-two disciple!

00:07:16.499 --> 00:07:17.750
He's pretty huge.

00:07:18.209 --> 00:07:21.337
Now, now.
/m stronger...probably.

00:07:21.546 --> 00:07:23.840
Remember all that
strenuous training!

00:07:24.507 --> 00:07:27.635
This guy's face Is...SCary.

00:07:29.303 --> 00:07:32.348
Give me your face...

00:07:36.352 --> 00:07:37.353
Found it.

00:07:38.104 --> 00:07:39.355
You will be eliminated.

00:07:39.522 --> 00:07:42.608
Oho? Somebody famous.

00:07:42.692 --> 00:07:45.987
Can I carve off your face too?!

00:08:01.544 --> 00:08:04.630
How ya like my blade work?

00:08:06.299 --> 00:08:08.634
I baited you into hitting
my reinforced skull.

00:08:09.802 --> 00:08:11.429
High-Voltage Fist.

00:08:13.514 --> 00:08:14.473
Begone.

00:08:16.809 --> 00:08:18.728
He took care of it
in no time at all.

00:08:19.312 --> 00:08:22.356
Genos really does have
the power of a demon...

00:08:23.357 --> 00:08:24.358
Demon Cyborg!

00:08:24.817 --> 00:08:28.404
The last monster is two klicks
to your northwest.

00:08:28.571 --> 00:08:30.489
Several heroes have
already engaged it.

00:08:34.702 --> 00:08:35.661
Can you speak?

00:08:36.412 --> 00:08:40.750
When you fight the bastard,
don't take your eyes off him...

00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:42.418
He was always behind us...

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.921
A Class S hero?

00:08:45.129 --> 00:08:47.548
Have you got something against
cockroaches too?

00:08:48.633 --> 00:08:52.762
I have something against
bug monsters in general.

00:08:53.179 --> 00:08:54.263
This ts the fast one...

00:08:55.222 --> 00:08:56.933
/f I can take him out quickly,

00:08:57.391 --> 00:08:59.560
maybe I can still catch
Master's fight.

00:08:59.977 --> 00:09:01.854
Getting rid of me is hard.

00:09:03.147 --> 00:09:05.942
Jakumen taps out!

00:09:06.108 --> 00:09:08.653
Sourface wins with
a beautiful choke hold!

00:09:08.903 --> 00:09:11.155
The two fighters congratulate
one another!

00:09:11.364 --> 00:09:13.741
Such beautiful sportsmanship!

00:09:14.367 --> 00:09:15.910
Did you win, Sourface?

00:09:16.285 --> 00:09:19.038
What?! You didn't see the match,
Charanko?

00:09:19.246 --> 00:09:21.040
Your valiant sempai won!

00:09:21.207 --> 00:09:22.333
I was in the bathroom.

00:09:22.708 --> 00:09:24.043
You're hopeless.

00:09:24.168 --> 00:09:27.213
Wait. Your opponent next match...

00:09:27.546 --> 00:09:29.090
Be wary of him.

00:09:29.215 --> 00:09:30.925
I've seen Bakuzan in action. He's...

00:09:31.008 --> 00:09:32.718
— Oh, dang it.
— He's not the type to show mercy,

00:09:32.802 --> 00:09:34.470
—/undid my belt in the bathroom
— even toward inferior opponents.

00:09:34.595 --> 00:09:35.972
— and I forgot how to tie it again.

00:09:36.055 --> 00:09:38.015
Hey! Did you hear a word I said?!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:42.478
The next match is Charanko,
who advanced by beating Zakkos,

00:09:42.603 --> 00:09:46.857
versus two-time consecutive
champion Bakuzan.

00:09:47.191 --> 00:09:49.443
His frightening
"Dark Hell Killing Jutsu"

00:09:49.652 --> 00:09:52.321
has turned many of his matches
into pure bloodbaths!

00:09:52.405 --> 00:09:55.324
Will his opponent once again
be demolished

00:09:55.574 --> 00:09:58.619
and hospitalized after
a one-sided battle?

00:09:58.744 --> 00:09:59.578
Humph.

00:09:59.662 --> 00:10:02.832
All I do is teach lessons
to those who don't belong here.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.250
Listen up.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.170
When martial artists trade blows,
it's not some friendly "sport."

00:10:08.462 --> 00:10:10.381
It's kill or be killed, life and...

00:10:12.299 --> 00:10:13.342
Well, this'll do.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:15.886
/m so gonna kill you.

00:10:16.679 --> 00:10:17.096
Begin!

00:10:17.471 --> 00:10:18.556
Here we go, folks!

00:10:18.889 --> 00:10:23.227
How will Charanko fight against
the likes of Bakuzan?

00:10:23.352 --> 00:10:25.438
Armmm.
His guard's wide open.

00:10:25.896 --> 00:10:27.440
What's with this fool?

00:10:28.107 --> 00:10:29.984
Does he want to fight?

00:10:30.735 --> 00:10:34.613
Bakuzan boldly closes in!

00:10:34.739 --> 00:10:37.491
Are you...an amateur?

00:10:37.992 --> 00:10:38.951
Yeah.

00:10:39.118 --> 00:10:41.203
Truth is,
this is my first time at this.

00:10:41.704 --> 00:10:44.040
Give me a taste
of your martial arts.

00:10:44.707 --> 00:10:46.042
Fine with me.

00:10:46.584 --> 00:10:49.420
I'll give you the full-service
execution you desire.

00:10:49.712 --> 00:10:50.713
Starting with the legs.

00:10:51.672 --> 00:10:55.092
My Demon Sweeper Low Kick
will shatter your bones

00:10:55.217 --> 00:10:56.719
so you never walk again.

00:10:58.054 --> 00:11:01.557
Next, your body, starting with
my Bear Killer Mid Kick...

00:11:02.641 --> 00:11:04.393
...followed by my Carnage Punch.

00:11:04.852 --> 00:11:08.355
Both your arms will break,
and your major organs will explode.

00:11:08.689 --> 00:11:10.066
Finally, your head.

00:11:10.775 --> 00:11:13.819
My Hell-Bringin' Hand Chop
will split your skull

00:11:13.861 --> 00:11:14.653
and send you straight—

00:11:15.571 --> 00:11:17.114
Don't touch my head!

00:11:22.578 --> 00:11:23.746
He's outside the ring...

00:11:24.413 --> 00:11:25.372
Darn it.

00:11:25.581 --> 00:11:27.041
I forgot to have the match.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.459
The fight is over!

00:11:28.584 --> 00:11:30.503
Call the doctor!
Bring the stretcher!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.381
What a bracket buster that was!

00:11:34.465 --> 00:11:36.926
Bakuzan, a contender
for the championship,

00:11:37.134 --> 00:11:39.595
beaten by first-time fighter,
Charanko!

00:11:40.429 --> 00:11:42.431
Another single-hit knockout.

00:11:42.807 --> 00:11:45.768
All right. I'll do that too.

00:11:47.728 --> 00:11:50.272
We've invited Mr. Saynuthin
to tell us about

00:11:50.356 --> 00:11:52.650
the monster emergencies
OCCUITING iN various areas.

00:11:53.692 --> 00:11:55.778
Mr. Saynuthin,
What are your thoughts

00:11:55.903 --> 00:11:59.031
on the simultaneous monster attacks
going on right now?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.493
MR. SAYNUTHIN

00:12:03.744 --> 00:12:06.372
Ah, we have some breaking news.

00:12:07.331 --> 00:12:12.545
Class A hero Lightning Genji
was found collapsed

00:12:13.129 --> 00:12:15.089
Any comment, Sir,
on this new development?

00:12:16.507 --> 00:12:19.593
It seems were all
searching for the right words.

00:12:19.885 --> 00:12:21.137
Pull yourself together!

00:12:22.763 --> 00:12:23.430
Ow!

00:12:23.514 --> 00:12:25.057
Are you okay, Mohican?

00:12:25.349 --> 00:12:27.601
This man's son
should be here with him.

00:12:28.144 --> 00:12:29.436
What happened to the child?

00:12:32.106 --> 00:12:35.901
Mr. Narinki's son, Waganma,
was kidnapped by monsters.

00:12:36.443 --> 00:12:38.445
What?! For what purpose?

00:12:38.904 --> 00:12:39.864
Unknown.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.366
But Mr. Narinki
represents seven percent

00:12:42.616 --> 00:12:44.702
of the Association's funding.

00:12:45.035 --> 00:12:47.496
Losing his trust
would be devastating.

00:12:47.663 --> 00:12:48.664
Indeed.

00:12:48.831 --> 00:12:51.667
The rescue of Waganma is
of the utmost priority.

00:12:52.001 --> 00:12:55.588
Put every Class A hero
in the city on it.

00:12:55.671 --> 00:12:56.547
But sir...

00:12:56.672 --> 00:12:59.466
Can we allow the monsters' rampage
to go unchecked?

00:13:00.176 --> 00:13:02.303
Class S hero Metal Bat

00:13:02.386 --> 00:13:04.513
was found unconscious
and in critical condition.

00:13:06.182 --> 00:13:08.267
C'mon! What's the matter?

00:13:10.936 --> 00:13:12.897
You can't hit me like that!

00:13:13.063 --> 00:13:13.731
Tsk...

00:13:13.856 --> 00:13:15.357
Cannot track his movements!

00:13:16.525 --> 00:13:18.694
Looking for me?
Here I am!

00:13:23.449 --> 00:13:24.700
It is not just his speed.

00:13:25.367 --> 00:13:27.244
On top of his unique gait
throwing me off

00:13:27.745 --> 00:13:30.122
he's attacking from
the buildings' blind spots.

00:13:30.581 --> 00:13:31.540
No other option.

00:13:32.374 --> 00:13:34.251
I did not want to use this, but...

00:13:35.586 --> 00:13:38.797
You got some special ability
you've been squirreling away?

00:13:39.215 --> 00:13:41.842
Gonna shoot laser beams
from your eyes or something?

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.387
Originally, I opposed installing
this component,

00:13:45.971 --> 00:13:47.640
but Doctor Kuseno was right.

00:13:47.765 --> 00:13:49.058
Hunter-seeker missiles?

00:13:49.141 --> 00:13:50.184
Poison gas?

00:13:50.643 --> 00:13:53.520
In situations where I face
a superior adversary,

00:13:53.896 --> 00:13:56.232
I must acknowleage reality
If I arm to grow.

00:13:56.482 --> 00:13:59.902
I sure hope it's not
roach repellent!

00:14:00.611 --> 00:14:02.238
W-What's this?!

00:14:02.529 --> 00:14:03.739
My legs...!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.199
What have you done?!

00:14:05.741 --> 00:14:08.160
It's an ultra-strong adhesive.

00:14:08.369 --> 00:14:13.082
I came prepared to stop even
a speedy ninja in his tracks.

00:14:14.375 --> 00:14:18.545
But to use this would acknowledge
his speed is an issue for me.

00:14:18.754 --> 00:14:20.089
What're you talking about?

00:14:20.881 --> 00:14:23.092
No concern of yours.

00:14:23.801 --> 00:14:24.885
Incinerate.

00:14:34.561 --> 00:14:36.397
He sacrificed his legs to escape?

00:14:36.939 --> 00:14:38.440
No matter. It is still fatal.

00:14:39.525 --> 00:14:40.943
Better return to the stadium.

00:14:41.819 --> 00:14:43.654
I might make Master's tight.

00:14:45.114 --> 00:14:46.407
High-speed object approaching!

00:14:47.116 --> 00:14:48.075
The roach?!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.744
No, something different...

00:14:59.044 --> 00:15:00.129
You guys...

00:15:00.462 --> 00:15:02.631
Don't fall so easily
for the enemy's tricks.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.301
Your face is so cute
when painted with panic.

00:15:05.467 --> 00:15:09.305
Unfortunately, these fools
are my pets now.

00:15:12.266 --> 00:15:14.560
Did that feel good,
having your lackeys taken?

00:15:14.935 --> 00:15:17.521
Come now, I want to see you
resist me more!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.315
Or have you been holding back?

00:15:20.774 --> 00:15:24.778
What if I let you join
Mistress Super S's harem of slaves?

00:15:31.285 --> 00:15:33.537
It! come back to hurt you...

00:15:33.662 --> 00:15:34.830
Shut up!

00:15:36.332 --> 00:15:39.543
You've held up,
even after taking on so many.

00:15:40.669 --> 00:15:42.963
But how much more can you take?

00:15:47.593 --> 00:15:50.304
Time for some rea/ punishment!

00:15:56.018 --> 00:15:57.519
That did the trick.

00:15:57.853 --> 00:16:00.397
Now you're mine, body and soul.

00:16:00.564 --> 00:16:04.026
And I believe you're one of those
esper sisters, yes?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:09.365
Your younger sister is
the Class S hero Terrible Tornado.

00:16:09.865 --> 00:16:15.412
Which means I can use you as bait
to tempt her to come out and play!

00:16:15.704 --> 00:16:17.956
She'll make a far better toy.

00:16:27.216 --> 00:16:29.301
Even after all that lash,
her mind's her own.

00:16:29.802 --> 00:16:31.553
Such strength of will...

00:16:31.887 --> 00:16:33.180
I hate girls like her.

00:16:37.559 --> 00:16:40.062
That hurt, bitch!

00:16:40.896 --> 00:16:44.233
I thought you'd be the bait to snag
your little sister, but forget it!

00:16:44.566 --> 00:16:46.527
I'm killing you right now!

00:16:47.528 --> 00:16:50.948
My fig sister will come,
even without bait.

00:16:52.658 --> 00:16:54.159
What are these tremors?!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.412
She was closer than I thought.

00:16:57.246 --> 00:16:59.790
She felt it when I was in pain.

00:17:01.208 --> 00:17:02.334
Here she is.

00:17:02.918 --> 00:17:03.919
Explosions?

00:17:04.711 --> 00:17:06.422
Something is approaching...

00:17:06.964 --> 00:17:08.590
Something frightening.

00:17:12.511 --> 00:17:13.512
My sister...

00:17:14.596 --> 00:17:16.473
Terrible Tornado!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.519
Super S!

00:17:21.478 --> 00:17:24.273
The heroes had a monster
of their own...!

00:17:25.149 --> 00:17:28.444
— This is more serious than I imagined.
— Our side...was wiped out...

00:17:28.527 --> 00:17:30.446
We need to retreat and regroup...

00:17:30.946 --> 00:17:31.697
That's her.

00:17:34.074 --> 00:17:35.117
Sister. ...!

00:17:35.451 --> 00:17:37.411
I'm still fignting this—

00:17:37.494 --> 00:17:40.456
You can go home, Blizzard.

00:17:40.998 --> 00:17:43.208
I'll clean up the whole mess.

00:17:44.084 --> 00:17:45.127
You people!

00:17:45.252 --> 00:17:47.296
Delay her while I escape!

00:17:49.465 --> 00:17:50.466
Wait, Tornado!

00:17:50.632 --> 00:17:51.800
They're my team!

00:17:52.134 --> 00:17:53.135
Don't attack them!

00:17:58.265 --> 00:18:00.476
I said not to attack...

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:03.520
That was barely an attack.

00:18:03.687 --> 00:18:04.980
No, that counts...

00:18:05.063 --> 00:18:09.067
And these nobodies aren't a team,
they're just burdens.

00:18:09.526 --> 00:18:12.946
I don't know why you still
hang around with that Class B club.

00:18:13.447 --> 00:18:15.949
Now look!
The monster got away!

00:18:16.492 --> 00:18:18.702
Why'd I start chit-chatting
with you?

00:18:18.827 --> 00:18:21.163
There are other monsters
to destroy.

00:18:22.247 --> 00:18:24.124
Let the nobodies know, will you?

00:18:24.333 --> 00:18:25.667
In real emergencies,

00:18:25.751 --> 00:18:28.128
if they don't evacuate,
they're just in the way.

00:18:35.636 --> 00:18:36.929
I musint doubt myself.

00:18:37.012 --> 00:18:39.431
So I've tried to keep it
out of my mind,

00:18:40.098 --> 00:18:41.266
but I cant.

00:18:42.017 --> 00:18:43.685
It's bothering me again.

00:18:45.479 --> 00:18:46.688
Wanna eat humans!

00:18:46.772 --> 00:18:48.524
Wanna eat human flesh!

00:18:48.649 --> 00:18:49.566
That's far enough!

00:18:50.317 --> 00:18:53.153
Now that I, Snakebite Snek,
have arrived,

00:18:53.237 --> 00:18:55.322
you won't lay a finger on anyone!

00:18:55.948 --> 00:18:58.825
Looking back, I once shone
brighter than anyone.

00:18:59.368 --> 00:19:02.538
The pride of being one of
the few real heroes

00:19:03.163 --> 00:19:07.209
with the power to protect people
tilled my spirit.

00:19:08.168 --> 00:19:10.879
But then, gradually,
reality set in.

00:19:11.338 --> 00:19:14.258
There were others who,
try as I might, I could never defeat.

00:19:15.133 --> 00:19:17.135
Even among the nameless masses,

00:19:17.219 --> 00:19:20.222
there were others far stronger
than myself.

00:19:21.181 --> 00:19:24.309
Are professional heroes
really necessary?

00:19:24.476 --> 00:19:26.395
Recently, I've been having doubts.

00:19:27.229 --> 00:19:28.981
If I didn't exist...

00:19:29.648 --> 00:19:31.692
If the Hero Association
didn't exist...

00:19:32.067 --> 00:19:35.946
Would there be someone who would
defeat the monsters in our place?

00:19:36.655 --> 00:19:38.323
At the very least,

00:19:38.407 --> 00:19:41.326
there seems no need
to protect this man.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.038
I liked Max from earlier.
He was nice and aggressive.

00:19:45.289 --> 00:19:47.291
Says the guy who's
been on his heels

00:19:47.416 --> 00:19:48.542
and won't fight back?

00:19:49.209 --> 00:19:52.170
I was just checking out
how skilled you are.

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.465
Class A heroes make
a lot of money, I hear.

00:19:55.966 --> 00:19:59.177
If your level is all it takes,
it might be worth my while.

00:20:00.137 --> 00:20:02.931
Just kidding.
I want money, not a job!

00:20:04.057 --> 00:20:05.601
How'd you get to be strong?

00:20:06.435 --> 00:20:10.355
Why is a guy like you,
who has no real purpose, so strong?

00:20:12.024 --> 00:20:13.817
Just talented, maybe?

00:20:14.026 --> 00:20:15.902
Everything about you disgusts me.

00:20:16.236 --> 00:20:19.489
Back when I trained, all I did
was keep my master company.

00:20:20.449 --> 00:20:22.451
I haven't even practiced in years.

00:20:23.285 --> 00:20:25.787
But how'd you get to be a hero?

00:20:26.455 --> 00:20:27.998
I mean, with that level of ability.

00:20:28.123 --> 00:20:29.791
W-What?!

00:20:30.167 --> 00:20:32.377
More and more
stronger monsters are appearing.

00:20:32.753 --> 00:20:35.797
Even performing at your best,
you won't make any difference.

00:20:36.673 --> 00:20:38.091
Heroes or no heroes,

00:20:38.175 --> 00:20:40.385
those who are going to survive
will survive.

00:20:40.761 --> 00:20:41.970
Monsters or no monsters,

00:20:42.054 --> 00:20:44.264
natural selection will
weed out the weak.

00:20:44.848 --> 00:20:46.475
It's the way things are.

00:20:46.767 --> 00:20:48.935
Are you suggesting we ignore

00:20:49.019 --> 00:20:51.355
the people being attacked
by monsters?

00:20:51.772 --> 00:20:53.357
— What's going on?
— Is this part of the show?

00:20:54.524 --> 00:20:56.318
— Monsters!
= How'd they get I in the hospital?!

00:20:56.777 --> 00:21:03.533
We'll hold them off here!

00:21:03.784 --> 00:21:06.119
What's a monster doing at a prison?

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:09.164
If you came for the Boss,
he broke out to bash you bastards!

00:21:09.247 --> 00:21:11.333
Puri-puri Prisoner is not here?

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:13.377
Doesn't matter.

00:21:13.752 --> 00:21:15.379
Who do you mean by "we"?

00:21:19.341 --> 00:21:20.425
The strong, of course.

00:21:21.593 --> 00:21:22.552
What?

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.847
Understand now?

00:21:29.935 --> 00:21:30.977
They sound excited.

00:21:42.364 --> 00:21:47.369
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:21:47.452 --> 00:21:52.082
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:21:52.624 --> 00:21:58.088
Will the future call
or Will it slip away?

00:21:58.213 --> 00:22:03.093
There's just so much
that we dont know

00:22:03.385 --> 00:22:08.640
But one day, weil make peace
within ourselves

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:14.312
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:14.396 --> 00:22:19.526
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:22:19.609 --> 00:22:23.613
That's what we are to each other

00:22:23.697 --> 00:22:29.995
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:22:30.162 --> 00:22:34.541
That kindness Is the true strength

00:22:34.624 --> 00:22:40.922
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:22:41.089 --> 00:22:46.344
So I promise that I'll come back

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:52.184
I promise that lil come back to you

00:23:02.861 --> 00:23:04.613
Report, Gyoro-Gyoro.

00:23:04.738 --> 00:23:07.491
Have my monsters created chaos?

00:23:07.657 --> 00:23:10.786
Oh, yes indeed.
Some casualties were incurred,

00:23:10.869 --> 00:23:13.371
but overall, the advantage
belongs to us.

00:23:13.455 --> 00:23:15.540
The Hero Association is in a panic.

00:23:16.374 --> 00:23:18.251
And what of Goketsu?

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:20.337
He's heading to the venue

00:23:20.462 --> 00:23:23.131
where the martial artists
have gathered.

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.677
Our confirmed victories include
Demon Cyborg,

00:23:27.969 --> 00:23:29.387
Metal Bat,

00:23:29.721 --> 00:23:31.598
and Metal Knight.

00:23:31.973 --> 00:23:35.977
Yet our greatest weapons
still await their turn.

00:23:36.353 --> 00:23:39.815
You may be assured of the Monster
Association's overwhelming victory,

00:23:40.273 --> 00:23:43.151
O Monster King Orochi!

00:23:45.612 --> 00:23:50.367
THE CLASS S
HEROES
